higan (102-1) experimental; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release. (Closes: #837553)
  * Higan no longer has profiles (accuracy, balanced, performance).
    New versions of higan use what used to be the accuracy profile.
    Consequently the update-alternatives mechanism to choose a profile
    was removed from the package.
  * Switch to dh compat level 10.
  * Use install target of upstream makefile.
  * Remove disable_long_double_size_check.patch (applied upstream).
  * Disable udev on kfreebsd. (Closes: #834061)

